      "id": "u_9caa697aabd7647cf149bf74_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The CKEditor is the WYSIWYG (standing for What You See Is What You Get) editor behind __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes.",
